# Keep text files LF everywhere. The repo is developed on Windows with
# core.autocrlf=true, which converts LF to CRLF on checkout. Node tests read the
# working-tree files directly (server/careerSkills.test.js parses SKILL.md
# frontmatter with /^---\n/), so a CRLF working copy fails the suite while
# `git status` still reports clean.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be touched by the EOL filter.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
